      "message": "Ah, I see you have the other half of this in https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/467136 . These CLs don\u0027t actually seem that large, would it be easier to combine these two CLs and also remove the field at the same time?\n\nThat being said, these two CLs have already been written and put out there and are fine so long as the cleanup happens after they land. While I\u0027d prefer the return type to not just be some random unnamed tuple (in particular that the return types of SkStrikeSpec::MakeCanonicalized and SkStrikeSpec::MakePath be more obviously related) the language tends to make that rather verbose, so I\u0027m fine leaving it out.",
